Package: com.example.multitaskfloat
Name: Multitask Float Bar for LiveContainer
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Simplifies LiveContainer multitasking window bars: keeps only the app title menu and the minimize button, and turns the bar into a dark translucent strip floating over the app instead of a fixed row.
Maintainer: Local build
Author: Local build
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
